{"tipo":"carga","clubId":"chelsea-gb","anio":2025,"entidad":"chelsea-fc-holdings","perimetro":"consolidado","cita":{"md":"Clubes/Inglaterra/Chelsea/chelsea-fc-holdings-group-accounts-2024-25.md","linea":113,"texto":"financial statements of Chelsea FC Holdings Limited (“the Company”) and its subsidiary undertakings (“the Group”"},"nota":{"es":"El balance que Chelsea publica en Companies House es el del grupo Chelsea FC Holdings, no el de Chelsea Football Club Limited solo: incluye el hotel, los estacionamientos y los inmuebles. Lo que Chelsea le factura a Strasbourg (15,8 M £ en 2024/25) es una operación entre partes relacionadas y está dentro de los ingresos.","en":"The accounts Chelsea files at Companies House are those of the Chelsea FC Holdings group, not of Chelsea Football Club Limited alone: they include the hotel, the car parks and the property. What Chelsea invoices Strasbourg (£15.8m in 2024/25) is a related-party transaction and is part of revenue."}}
